## Description
This pull request reduces the overall hardware cost of the AI-Based Elephant Intrusion Detection System by replacing expensive components with affordable alternatives while maintaining similar functionality.

## Changes Made

### Component Replacement

| Existing Component | New Component | Reason |
|-------------------|--------------|--------|
| Raspberry Pi 4 | Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ | Lower cost and sufficient processing power for YOLO Tiny models |
| Pi Camera V2 | ESP32-CAM | Built-in camera with Wi-Fi support and lower price |
| GSM Module (SIM900A) | SIM800L | Smaller, cheaper, and supports SMS alerts |
| 7-inch LCD Display | 16x2 I2C LCD / OLED Display | Only alert messages are required |
| High Power Speaker | Active Buzzer | Cost-effective warning system |
| Large UPS | 5V Power Bank | Portable backup power solution |

